  "body": "To attend the Open Home, your Vaccine Pass and Photo ID is required or contact Salesperson for a private viewing.\r\n\r\n• Sitting on a 313m2 site\r\n• 225m2 (approx) of floor area including 5 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms\r\n• The stylish kitchen has top quality Bosch appliances satisfying all your cooking needs\r\n• Granny potential downstairs, 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom, separate entrance\r\n• Internal access from the double garage offers extra convenience \r\n• Air conditioning unit in the dining/living area makes sure the right temperature for the whole season\r\n• This property also comes with a 10 Year Master Builders Warranty providing you peace of mind\r\n\r\nMoments away from the expanding Silverdale, Highgate Business Park and Silverdale Industrial Centre, residents are in zone for several public and private schools. Enjoy a growing number of cafes and restaurants, plus world class recreational and medical facilities. Offering walking distance to Silverdale Park & Ride, providing the option to live, work and play in your own backyard.\r\n\r\nIf you and your family are looking to move into a thriving community with so many amenities on your doorstep, I recommend an early viewing.\r\n\r\nBe quick to secure your interest, as this won't last long. Call me now to book your private viewing, you will feel very relaxed here!\r\n\r\nSee property documents for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View their website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
